DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The wwbbeennvv driver provides support for the Winbond W83L784R, W83L785R and
     W83L785TS-L hardware monitors to be used with the sysctl(8) interface.

     The W83L874R and W83L785R possess several voltage, temperature and fan
     speed sensors.  The W83L785TS-L only has a single temperature sensor.

